OL,3,GNEWSACricket club hopes to rebuild
OL,4,Apavilion after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cricket club has revealed plans to
OL,7,Frebuild its pavilion after it was
OL,8,Fdestroyed in an arson attack a year
OL,9,Fago.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to Bures
OL,12,Fand District Cricket Club, on the
OL,13,FEssex/Suffolk border, in September last
OL,14,Fyear to a blaze that consumed the
OL,15,Fnearly 200-year-old thatched building.
OL,17,FIn plans submitted to Babergh District
OL,18,FCouncil, the club is seeking to build a
OL,19,Fnew pavilion at the Wharf Lane ground,
OL,20,Fto be used not only by the team but
OL,21,Falso by the wider community.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
