OL,3,GNEWSACricket club hopes to rebuild
OL,4,Apavilion after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The pavilion had served the club and
OL,7,Fthe local community for many years, and
OL,8,Fits loss has created a significant gap
OL,9,Fin the sporting and social facilities
OL,10,Favailable at the cricket ground," it
OL,11,Fsaid.
